   "ai_informationAboutTraining": "Pre-trained on the Dolma 3 dataset, then post-trained in three stages on Dolci datasets: Stage 1 SFT (supervised fine-tuning), Stage 2 DPO (direct preference optimization), Stage 3 RLVR (reinforcement learning from verifiable rewards).",
   "comment": "releaseTime: release date not stated in the card; Hugging Face repo creation time used.\nacceptable_use_policy: Licensed under Apache 2.0; intended for research and educational use in accordance with Ai2's Responsible Use Guidelines (https://allenai.org/responsible-use)\naccess_conditions: false\nadditional_assets: Code, checkpoints and training details are released: Open-Instruct (DPO and RLVR), OLMo-Core (pre-training and SFT) and OLMo-Eval (evaluation) on GitHub; checkpoints accessible via Hugging Face revisions (e.g. step_XXXX naming; only the final few checkpoints for this model); training datasets (Dolci-Instruct-SFT, Dolci-Instruct-DPO, Dolci-Instruct-RL) on Hugging Face; logs coming soon.\nintegration_means: Use with the HuggingFace transformers library (transformers 4.57.0 or higher) via AutoModelForCausalLM/AutoTokenizer; optional 8-bit quantization with bitsandbytes; specific checkpoints loadable via the revision argument; fine-tuning with the OLMo-core repository.\nbase_model_relation: finetune"
